    <string name="s_1afbfccf" formatted="false">File format</string>
    <string name="s_deb1c628" formatted="false">Columns</string>
    <string name="s_a69b6ee9" formatted="false">Use the Excel (.xlsx) exported by Mi Tensión as a template. Keep the first row and column order; do not use formulas.</string>
    <string name="s_16d098e2" formatted="false">Each row from the second onward is a separate reading. Import 1, 2 or 3 morning or evening readings per day; they are not averaged and three are not required.</string>
    <string name="s_e993def4" formatted="false">Morning and evening are calculated from local date and time: before 14:00 is morning; from 14:00 is evening. Column B does not override this.</string>
    <string name="s_f955df66" formatted="false">A, C, D and G are required. A must be an Excel date/time, not text; C and D are whole numbers without units. E, F and H may be empty.</string>
    <string name="s_3526c142" formatted="false">G identifies each reading: keep its UUID to avoid duplicates and use a different UUID for a new reading. I, J and K are hidden technical columns; do not edit them or copy their values to new readings.</string>
    <string name="s_d9dc4ecc" formatted="false">Pinch or double-tap to zoom.</string>
    <string name="s_d4b1d477" formatted="false">Tap to enlarge the image.</string>
    <string name="s_4d5c2d62" formatted="false">Import records from Excel</string>
    <string name="s_bd37a5c3" formatted="false">Choose an Excel file exported by Mi Tensión. New records are added without deleting your history or duplicating readings.</string>
    <string name="s_d8215a28" formatted="false">Could not import Excel. Use a file exported by Mi Tensión with valid records.</string>
    <string name="s_ef3d37a3" formatted="false">Second reminders scheduled: %ld</string>
    <string name="s_7ba6fa8a" formatted="false">30 minutes have passed and you have not saved a reading for this period. Record it when you can.</string>
    <string name="s_6afcd43b" formatted="false">The second reminder could not be updated. Check notification permissions and reopen Reminders.</string>
    <string name="s_19bc8f2c" formatted="false">If no reading is saved for that day and period, a second notification with sound arrives 30 minutes later. It repeats only once. The next 21 days are scheduled and renewed when you open the app; open Mi Tensión at least every three weeks. The system alarm does not repeat.</string>
